# The repository root ignores every directory named `data/` so that no real
# runtime artifact -- audio, transcripts, summaries, mentions, cache -- can be
# committed by accident. That policy stays exactly as it is.
#
# This one tree is the deliberate exception. Everything under it is synthetic,
# generated by `examples/generate_sample_corpus.py` from hand-written fictional
# transcripts, and committed so a reader or an agent can query the tools
# without first running a 20-minute download-and-transcribe pipeline.
#
# Scope is one directory. `data/` at the repository root, and any other `data/`
# anywhere else, is still ignored.
!/data/
